    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raccoon Roller is a physics based precision platformer that tests your creative thinking and mechanical skill. With 40 unique levels to explore, discover various routes as you race for gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock stylish accessories and high-skill bonus levels through in-game collectables and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master advanced movement techniques to speed through levels and become unbeatable on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADDITIONAL FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboard support with optional friends filtering.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/b4374f6e33ac970c060111bb57ef99f6.avif?t=1733148580\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raccoon Roller is a physics based precision platformer that tests your creative thinking and mechanical skill. With 40 unique levels to explore, discover various routes as you race for gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/671530b2991c632479e4b7d44c23f8db.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock stylish accessories and high-skill bonus levels through in-game collectables and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/03099b370fb24b3cf676d0eb9ce55aab.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master advanced movement techniques to speed through levels and become unbeatable on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.poster.avif?t=1733148580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.webm?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/7a42a7b5bccaa4a50cdea858bbc41482.mp4?t=1733148580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADDITIONAL FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboard support with optional friends filtering.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1373980/extras/b4374f6e33ac970c060111bb57ef99f6.avif?t=1733148580\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
